<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Morningstar EPS view up.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Morningstar EPS view up.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin and Jenrette analyst William Leach said he raised in earnings estimates for Morningstar Group Inc on Thursday to $1.30 a share from $1.25 for 1997 and to $1.65 from $1.60 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- He reiterated his buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- This followed Morningstar's first quarter earnings of $0.27 a share, up from $0.19 a year ago. Sales for the quarter increased to $130.3 million from $81.7 million.</p>
<p>-- Morningstar shares were down 3/4 to 22-1/2.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
